mw2coop patch for maps/so_showers_gulag.gsc (Spec Ops: Bathroom Fight, Gulag showers): the bathroom's first seconds spare both players.

1. Entering the bathroom (flag player_enters_bathroom), the enemies could not hit player 1 for 6 s, while player 2 took their full fire
   (Spec Ops audit 2026-11-17, item 1.4). Both players get the 6 s.
@@@ replace
	level.player.attackeraccuracy = 0;
	level.player delayThread( 6, maps\_gameskill::update_player_attacker_accuracy );
@@@ with
	foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
	{
		mw2coop_player.attackeraccuracy = 0;
		mw2coop_player delayThread( 6, maps\_gameskill::update_player_attacker_accuracy );
	}
@@@ end
